(286304, 20139, 4007, '<td valign="top">I love the style of this one.  It is simple, stark, but also attention getting.  I''m not sure if it gives enough information (something about digital photography or a contest might have helped) to draw in a good potential user, but I love the general appeal of this.  9</td>', 'I love the style of this one.  It is simple, stark, but also attention getting.  I''m not sure if it gives enough information (something about digital photography or a contest might have helped) to draw in a good potential user, but I love the general appeal of this.  9', '2003-05-02 21:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
